<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Pacific Dunlop yr loss A$132.74 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Pacific Dunlop yr loss A$132.74 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   263.65 vs 381.7</p>
<p>    Net			     loss 132.74 vs profit 94.2</p>
<p>    Abnormals		     loss 284.55 vs profit 197.3</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     3.0  vs 11.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Pacific Dunlop Ltd is a diversified industrial group.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	    14.0  vs  22.5</p>
<p>    Sales (billion)			6.47 vs   7.31</p>
<p>    Other income (billion)	     0.58 vs   1.19</p>
