<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date November 15</p>
<p>Reg date October 11</p>
<p>    Tax				    105.62 vs  81.16</p>
<p>    Interest			     171.41 vs 203.11</p>
<p>    Depreciation			 170.37 vs 223.83</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
